<title>UK: Charter yr underlying pretax profit flat.</title>
<headline>Charter yr underlying pretax profit flat.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996 (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		70.9		   vs 67.5</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 29.5		   vs 27.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     96.0		   vs 97.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   883.4		  vs 854.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Engineering and equipment group Charter Plc said its pretax and earnings data excluded an exceptional item of a 50 million stg write-back of goodwill after the disposal of its 65.3 percent interest in Cape.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44-171 542 7717</p>
</text>
